      "widgets_values": [
        "soft-focus contemporary impressionist portrait of a young man with messy dark hair, shown in an intimate close-up with his face, neck, and shoulders filling the frame in a loose diagonal composition. His head tips upward in a long, exhausted sigh, lips parted, expression emotionally fried, while one arm flings outward to the side holding a bright aluminum energy drink can, the gesture reading as both dependence and dismissal. He wears a loose white tee or thin hoodie that dissolves into the background. Pale diffused light, blush pink, ivory, pearl, and cool blue-gray tones, smoky dark hair masses, visible loose brushstrokes, feathered edges, hazy bloom, and partially unfinished passages create a romantic painterly image with a Gen Z undertone of overstimulation and caffeinated burnout.",
