      ],
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Krea Moodboards Workflow Notes\n\nThis workflow is for testing multiple Krea moodboard styles.\n\nEach section uses its own prompt, moodboard ID, and save node.\n\n\n## Before You Run\n\nAll moodboard sections may be active at once.\n\nIf you press run without bypassing anything, Comfy may try to generate every section.\n\nTo run only one moodboard section:\n\n- Drag-select the nodes you do not want to run.\n- Press `Cmd+B` to bypass them.\n\nYou can also right-click the canvas or group area and choose **Bypass Group**.\n\nLeave only the moodboard section you want to test active.\n\n\n## Changing The Moodboard\n\nMoodboards are customizable.\n\nYou can use your own Krea moodboard instead of the included examples.\n\nTo use your own moodboard:\n\n- Go to https://www.krea.ai/moodboards.\n- Create a new moodboard.\n- Add your reference images.\n- Share or publish the moodboard so it is live.\n- Copy the moodboard ID from the URL.\n- Paste that ID into the `moodboard_id` field in the Krea node.\n\nExample moodboard ID:\n\n`7947e7b8-750e-4dbd-877a-d554d86f85d1`\n\n\n## Basic Controls\n\n**prompt**  \nThe image prompt you want Krea to generate.\n\n**moodboard_id**  \nThe Krea moodboard style being used.\n\n**moodboard_strength**  \nHow strongly the moodboard affects the result.\n\n**aspect_ratio**  \nThe output shape.\n\n**seed**  \nChange or randomize this for new variations.\n\n\n## Suggested Workflow\n\n- Choose one moodboard section.\n- Bypass all other sections.\n- Edit the prompt if needed.\n- Add or replace the moodboard ID.\n- Run the workflow.\n- Compare the saved output."
      ]
    }
